  "description": "For some reason, Seo-Yeon begins seeing strange things. Ghosts appearing out of the blue are interfering with her work and love life, and she's on the brink of disaster! Hyun-U appears in a critical moment to help, but something feels off about this man who can banish ghosts with his fingertips.\n\n*\"Can I help you?\"*\n\nHyun-U's gentle voice slowly shakes Seo-Yeon...\n\nHer chilling yet sweet journey with the mysterious Mr. Lee begins now.\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
